vendored canon talking about itself is not ours to police), resolves each
reference against tracked files and their directories, and stays quiet about
shared/ paths when the mount is not checked out. Five fixtures in
pack.test.mjs: quiet on a resolving path and on a directory reference, firing
on a path the mount no longer holds, and the two scope guards — plus the
existing live case, which now runs every rule against the real tree.

